# oracle: cut-down of examples/PACKAGES/neighbor-swap/in.KMC_pulse_edge (MEAM NiCr with a bottom slab of type 2, fix npt, fix neighbor/swap diff 2 on compute voronoi/atom neighbors yes): 144 atoms, 10 steps, MC every 5 steps with 4 cycles; counters and per-atom state are native's
# Measured (ORACLE_MEASURE=1): thermo 6.5e-15, atoms 1.2e-13 (max relative error; counters 4/4 and 8/8 equal); engine ~1.5-3 s warm. native: lmp b332f28 (VORONOI, MC, MEAM), sort off.
# oracle-potentials: library_2nn.meam MoCoNiVFeAlCr_2nn.meam
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-8 abs=1e-10
units           metal
dimension       3
boundary        p p p
atom_style      atomic
atom_modify     map array sort 0 0.0
lattice         fcc 3.762
region          whole block 0 1 0 1 0 1
create_box      2 whole
create_atoms    1 region whole
replicate       3 4 3
region          puck block INF INF INF 1 INF INF
set             region puck type 2
pair_style      meam
pair_coeff      * * library_2nn.meam Mo Co Ni V Fe Al Cr MoCoNiVFeAlCr_2nn.meam Ni Cr
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
timestep        0.002
thermo          5
compute         voroN all voronoi/atom neighbors yes
run             0
thermo_style    custom step temp press pxx pyy pzz lx ly lz vol pe
velocity        all create 2400 908124 loop geom
fix             temp all npt temp 1000 1000 1000 aniso 0 0 1
fix             mc all neighbor/swap 5 4 1340723 1000 3.0 voroN diff 2
thermo_style    custom step temp press pxx pyy pzz lx ly lz vol pe f_mc[1] f_mc[2]
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
run             10
